@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get all expenses
GET {{host}}/expenses

### 2. Get expense 2
GET {{host}}/expenses/2

### 3. Get expense 99 (it doesn't exist)
GET {{host}}/expenses/99

### 4. Add an expense
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Movie night",
  "amount": 18,
  "category": "Fun"
}

### 5. Total of all expenses
GET {{host}}/expenses/total

### 6. Delete expense 99 (it doesn't exist)
DELETE {{host}}/expenses/99
